<div>
 <div class="custom-subscription-faq-section">
      <div class="custom-subscription-faq-section-container">
        <img class="bg-img mint-bg" width="200" height="auto" src="{{ 'mint-leaf.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="Mint leaf illustration">
        <div class="subscription-faq-body">
          <h2 class="subscription-faq-heading">Subscription Questions</h2>

          <div class="faq active">
            <div class="question">
              <h3 class="question-title">What is Craftmix?</h3>
              <div class="question-icon">
                <div class="icon-circle">
                  <div class="icon-line horizontal"></div>
                  <div class="icon-line vertical"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="answer">
              <p>Craftmix is a low sugar, low calorie cocktail mix in a convenient dry blend. Each packet makes one cocktail with just 25 calories and 5g of sugar—perfect for guilt-free happy hours anywhere.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq">
            <div class="question">
              <h3 class="question-title">How do I make a Craftmix cocktail?</h3>
              <div class="question-icon">
                <div class="icon-circle">
                  <div class="icon-line horizontal"></div>
                  <div class="icon-line vertical"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="answer">
              <p>Simply mix 1.5 oz of your favorite liquor with 3 oz of sparkling or still water, stir in one Craftmix packet, pour over ice, and enjoy!</p>
            </div>
          </div>

            <div class="faq">
            <div class="question">
              <h3 class="question-title">Can I enjoy Craftmix without alcohol?</h3>
              <div class="question-icon">
                <div class="icon-circle">
                  <div class="icon-line horizontal"></div>
                  <div class="icon-line vertical"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="answer">
              <p>Absolutely! Just swap the liquor for an extra 1.5 oz of sparkling water to make a refreshing mocktail.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq">
            <div class="question">
              <h3 class="question-title">Do you offer a subscription service?</h3>
              <div class="question-icon">
                <div class="icon-circle">
                  <div class="icon-line horizontal"></div>
                  <div class="icon-line vertical"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="answer">
              <p>Yes! The Craftmix Club delivers your favorite flavors on a regular schedule—plus you get discounts and exclusive perks as a subscriber.</p>
            </div>
          </div>



          <div class="faq-cta-container">
            <a class="faq-cta primary-cta" href="/pages/faq">More Questions? Visit our FAQ Page</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="sub-faq-image-wrapper">
          <img class="bg-img palmtree-bg" width="200" height="auto" src="{{ 'palmtree.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="Palm tree illustration">
          <img class="bg-img bloodorange-bg" width="200" height="auto" src="{{ 'bloodorange.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="Blood orange slice illustration">
          <div class="subscription-faq-image-container">
            <img class="subscription-faq-image" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2340/1623/files/BPH_0335-min.jpg?v=1747048507" alt="Hand holding a bright yellow cocktail garnished with a lime wheel and green-striped straw in a ribbed glass.">
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
</div>

{% style %}
  *,
*::before,
*::after {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

ul {
  list-style: none;
}

a {
  text-decoration: none;
}

img {
  max-width: 100%;
}

.custom-subscription-faq-section {
  padding-top: 100px;
  padding-bottom: 100px;
  background-color: #fff9f5;
}

.custom-subscription-faq-section-container {
  max-width: 1400px;
  padding: 0 45px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: row;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  position:relative;
  z-index:1;
}

.subscription-faq-body {
  max-width: 589px;
}
.subscription-faq-heading {
  opacity: 1;
  color: rgba(0, 38, 87, 1);
  font-family: 'Hornbill';
  font-size: 40px;
  font-weight: 700;
  font-style: Bold;
  letter-spacing: -1.05px;
  text-align: left;
  line-height: 46px;
  margin-bottom: 45px;
}

.faq {
  border-bottom: 1.5px solid rgba(0, 38, 87, 1);
  opacity: 1;
  margin-bottom: 5px;
}
.faq .question {
  min-height: 70px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: row;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
}
.faq .question-title {
  opacity: 1;
  color: rgba(0, 38, 87, 1);
  font-family: 'Goldplay';
  font-size: 18px;
  font-weight: 600;
  font-style: SemiBold;
  letter-spacing: -0.11px;
  text-align: left;
  line-height: 22px;
}

.faq .question {
  cursor: pointer;
}

.question-icon {
  width: 30px;
  height: 30px;
}

.icon-circle {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  border: 1px solid #002657;
  border-radius: 50%;
  position: relative;
  transition: all 0.3s ease;
  background-color: #60d3f8;
}

.icon-line {
  position: absolute;
  background-color: #002657;
  transition: all 0.3s ease;
}

.icon-line.horizontal {
  width: 60%;
  height: 2px;
  top: 50%;
  left: 20%;
  transform: translateY(-50%);
}

.icon-line.vertical {
  width: 2px;
  height: 60%;
  left: 50%;
  top: 20%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
}

.faq.active .icon-circle {
  background-color: #60d3f8;
  border-color: #002657;
}

.faq.active .icon-line {
  background-color: #002657;
}
.faq.active .icon-line.vertical {
  transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(90deg);
  opacity: 0;
}

.faq .question-icon:hover {
  cursor: pointer;
}


.faq .answer {
  max-height: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  transition: max-height 0.3s ease-out, padding 0.3s ease-out;
  padding-right: 80px;
  padding-bottom: 0;
}

.faq.active .answer {
  max-height: 1000px; 
  transition: max-height 0.5s ease-in, padding 0.5s ease-in;
  padding-bottom: 26px;
}

.faq .question-icon {
  width: 30px;
  height: 30px;
  transition: transform 0.3s ease;
}

.faq.active .question-icon {
  transform: rotate(180deg);
}

.faq .answer p {
  opacity: 0.9;
  color: rgba(0, 38, 87, 1);
  font-family: 'Goldplay';
  font-size: 18px;
  font-weight: 500;
  font-style: Medium;
  letter-spacing: -0.11px;
  text-align: left;
  line-height: 24px;
  padding-bottom: 26px;
}

.icon-open,
.faq.active .icon-close {
  display: none;
}

.icon-close,
.faq.active .icon-open {
  display: block;
}
.faq-cta-container{
  text-align:center;
}
.faq-cta {
  border-radius: 33px;
  border: 1.5px solid rgba(0, 38, 87, 1);
  box-shadow: 2px 6px 0px rgba(0, 38, 87, 1);
  background-color: rgba(96, 211, 248, 1);
  display: inline-block;
  opacity: 1;
  color: rgba(0, 38, 87, 1);
  font-family: 'Goldplay';
  font-size: 20px;
  font-weight: 600;
  font-style: SemiBold;
  letter-spacing: -0.13px;
  text-align: center;
  line-height: 20px;
  padding: 20px 89px;
  margin-top: 62px;
  display: inline-block;
  max-width:90%;
}

.subscription-faq-image-container {
  width: 471px;
  height: 634px;
  border-radius: 30px;
  border: 1.5px solid rgba(0, 38, 87, 1);
  background-color: rgba(0, 169, 224, 1);
  overflow: hidden;
  max-width:100%;
  z-index: 1;
  position: relative;
}

.subscription-faq-image {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  z-index:1;
  position:relative;
}



.background-fruit {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 0;
  display: block;
}
.background-fruit.fruit-cherry {
 
}
.background-fruit.fruit-blueberry {
  
}
.sub-faq-image-wrapper{
  position:relative;
}
.palmtree-bg{
  top: -8rem;
  width: 250px;
  height: auto;
  left: -9rem;
  transform: rotate(-15deg);
}
.bloodorange-bg{
  right: -5rem;
  bottom: -3rem;
  width: 210px;
  height: auto;
  z-index: 0;
}
@media screen and (max-width: 1100px) {
  .custom-subscription-faq-section-container {
    padding: 0 25px;
  }
  .subscription-faq-body {
    max-width: 388px;
  }
}
@media screen and (max-width: 900px) {
  .custom-subscription-faq-section-container {
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 0 25px;
  }
  .subscription-faq-body {
    max-width: 388px;
  }
  .subscription-faq-image-container {
    margin-top: 84px;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  .subscription-faq-heading {
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-style: Bold;
    letter-spacing: -0.79px;
    text-align: left;
    line-height: 35px;
  }
  .faq .question-title {
    font-size: 16px;
    letter-spacing: -0.1px;
    text-align: left;
    line-height: 20px;
  }

  .faq .answer p {
    font-size: 16px;
    letter-spacing: -0.1px;
    text-align: left;
    line-height: 19px;
  }
  .faq-cta{
    max-width:100%;
  }
  .faq-cta-btn {
    padding: 20px 23px;
    margin-top: 62px;
    margin-bottom: 62px;
  }
  .palmtree-bg{
    top:1.5rem;
    left:-5rem;
    width:175px;
  }
  .bloodorange-bg{
    width: 160px;
    right: -3rem;
    bottom:0;
  }
}
{% endstyle %}

{% javascript %}
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {
  const faqs = document.querySelectorAll('.faq');

  faqs.forEach(faq => {
    const question = faq.querySelector('.question');
    const answer = faq.querySelector('.answer');
    if (!question || !answer) return;

    // Ensure focusability only
    if (!question.hasAttribute('tabindex')) {
      question.setAttribute('tabindex', '0');
    }

    // Initial state
    const isActive = faq.classList.contains('active');
    question.setAttribute('aria-expanded', isActive ? 'true' : 'false');
    answer.style.maxHeight = isActive ? answer.scrollHeight + 'px' : null;

    function toggleFaq() {
      const expanded = faq.classList.toggle('active');
      question.setAttribute('aria-expanded', expanded ? 'true' : 'false');
      answer.style.maxHeight = expanded ? answer.scrollHeight + 'px' : null;
    }

    // Mouse
    question.addEventListener('click', toggleFaq);

    // Keyboard
    question.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {
      if (e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' ') {
        e.preventDefault(); // stop Space from scrolling
        toggleFaq();
      }
    });
  });
});
{% endjavascript %}

